WEBVTT

1
00:00:29.833 --> 00:00:31.541
We have now learned

2
00:00:31.541 --> 00:00:35.250
that yoga brings many positive changes in life,

3
00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:38.208
and the yogi who has reached its supreme state

4
00:00:38.208 --> 00:00:41.666
becomes free from all sufferings.

5
00:00:41.666 --> 00:00:44.791
Now in this verse, Lord Krishna explains

6
00:00:44.791 --> 00:00:46.500
that success in yoga

7
00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:49.250
cannot come to a person in one day,

8
00:00:49.250 --> 00:00:51.916
but will definitely come one day.

9
00:00:51.916 --> 00:00:53.541
This is important,

10
00:00:53.541 --> 00:00:55.583
because on the path of yoga,

11
00:00:55.583 --> 00:00:58.291
patience is extremely essential.

12
00:01:02.958 --> 00:01:07.041
In this verse, Lord Krishna
 is describing the process of 

13
00:01:07.041 --> 00:01:10.583
reaching the supreme state of 
yoga, meaning samadhi.

14
00:01:10.583 --> 00:01:11.208
Lord Krishna

15
00:01:11.208 --> 00:01:13.125
begins this verse

16
00:01:13.125 --> 00:01:15.541
with the words shanaiḥ shanaiḥ –

17
00:01:15.541 --> 00:01:19.791
meaning gradually, slowly. The implication is

18
00:01:19.791 --> 00:01:24.500
that spiritual progress will happen only 
with patience and continuous practice.

19
00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:27.416
Just as a seed doesn't 
immediately become a plant

20
00:01:27.416 --> 00:01:30.875
and then a tree, it takes time,

21
00:01:30.875 --> 00:01:32.125
similarly,

22
00:01:32.125 --> 00:01:35.500
control over the mind 
won't happen quickly either.

23
00:01:35.500 --> 00:01:39.000
The mind is naturally unstable and restless,

24
00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:42.041
therefore bringing it under control is difficult.

25
00:01:42.041 --> 00:01:44.208
Lord Krishna gives this very advice:

26
00:01:44.208 --> 00:01:47.541
a person should take steps one by one

27
00:01:47.541 --> 00:01:50.583
and deepen their control and attention

28
00:01:50.583 --> 00:01:53.250
through small efforts.

29
00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:54.875
Intelligence has an

30
00:01:54.875 --> 00:01:57.041
important role in this process.

31
00:01:57.041 --> 00:01:58.041
Because intelligence

32
00:01:58.041 --> 00:02:00.875
helps us understand

33
00:02:00.875 --> 00:02:02.458
what is spiritually

34
00:02:02.458 --> 00:02:06.375
beneficial for us and what is not.

35
00:02:06.375 --> 00:02:09.750
But this understanding alone is not completely

36
00:02:09.750 --> 00:02:11.333
sufficient for us,

37
00:02:11.333 --> 00:02:15.083
because along with understanding, 
surrender is also needed.

38
00:02:15.083 --> 00:02:17.208
For which having firm faith in this process

39
00:02:17.208 --> 00:02:19.500
and purpose of yoga

40
00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:21.083
is extremely essential.

41
00:02:21.083 --> 00:02:24.833
If there's no firm faith, then a person will wander,

42
00:02:24.833 --> 00:02:27.125
or as soon as difficult moments come,

43
00:02:27.125 --> 00:02:30.041
will get discouraged and stop.

44
00:02:30.041 --> 00:02:32.250
And to keep this faith firm,

45
00:02:32.250 --> 00:02:33.583
studying scriptures

46
00:02:33.583 --> 00:02:35.583
and listening to teachers' teachings

47
00:02:35.583 --> 00:02:37.375
will prove effective.

48
00:02:37.375 --> 00:02:40.583
Continuously reading and 
listening to spiritual matters

49
00:02:40.583 --> 00:02:42.375
makes us firm,

50
00:02:42.375 --> 00:02:45.708
saves us from wandering 
even amidst difficulties.

51
00:02:45.708 --> 00:02:47.708
Lord Krishna also clarifies

52
00:02:47.708 --> 00:02:48.666
that the yogi must

53
00:02:48.666 --> 00:02:50.000
remove their mind from the senses

54
00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:52.833
and their material experiences,

55
00:02:52.833 --> 00:02:56.125
and focus it completely on their soul.

56
00:02:56.125 --> 00:02:56.958
The process of

57
00:02:56.958 --> 00:02:58.708
withdrawing the mind from the senses

58
00:02:58.708 --> 00:03:00.541
is called 'pratyahara',

59
00:03:00.541 --> 00:03:04.000
which is an important stage of yoga.

60
00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:07.000
Mind and senses will naturally

61
00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:11.250
be attracted toward the 
pleasure of this material world.

62
00:03:11.250 --> 00:03:14.833
Therefore Lord Krishna says that a yogi must

63
00:03:14.833 --> 00:03:17.916
remove mind and senses with 
the help of firm faith and intelligence

64
00:03:17.916 --> 00:03:19.375
from the attractions

65
00:03:19.375 --> 00:03:22.333
of this material world.

66
00:03:22.333 --> 00:03:25.583
Basically, instead of searching for bliss outside,

67
00:03:25.583 --> 00:03:28.708
one must search for that bliss within.

68
00:03:28.708 --> 00:03:31.541
This change won't happen immediately, but

69
00:03:31.541 --> 00:03:34.791
it will definitely happen 
with continuous practice.

70
00:03:34.791 --> 00:03:38.875
And ultimately, that time will
 also come when the yogi's mind

71
00:03:38.875 --> 00:03:42.750
will be focused only and only in their soul.

72
00:03:42.750 --> 00:03:46.375
Then neither will there be any
 effect of material attractions, nor

73
00:03:46.375 --> 00:03:48.208
of material sufferings.

74
00:03:48.208 --> 00:03:49.833
Making progress in yoga

75
00:03:49.833 --> 00:03:52.375
is like climbing a mountain.

76
00:03:52.375 --> 00:03:54.458
This mountain may seem high.

77
00:03:54.458 --> 00:03:57.500
Reaching its peak may seem difficult.

78
00:03:57.500 --> 00:03:59.833
But one who keeps moving forward

79
00:03:59.833 --> 00:04:03.458
step by step with firm determination

80
00:04:03.458 --> 00:04:07.541
will definitely reach the peak.

81
00:04:12.083 --> 00:04:14.666
Imagine,

82
00:04:14.666 --> 00:04:16.708
you want to reach the peak

83
00:04:16.708 --> 00:04:20.541
of a high mountain.

84
00:04:20.541 --> 00:04:23.750
The peak may seem difficult,

85
00:04:23.750 --> 00:04:25.791
may appear far.

86
00:04:25.791 --> 00:04:30.916
But is reaching it impossible?

87
00:04:30.916 --> 00:04:33.458
Absolutely not.

88
00:04:33.458 --> 00:04:37.541
The first step of the journey 
must be taken, and then

89
00:04:37.541 --> 00:04:40.333
with patience and firmness

90
00:04:40.333 --> 00:04:44.125
one must move forward step by step.

91
00:04:44.125 --> 00:04:45.958
If there's fatigue in between,

92
00:04:45.958 --> 00:04:48.416
rest can certainly be taken.

93
00:04:48.416 --> 00:04:52.041
But after rest,

94
00:04:52.041 --> 00:04:53.666
the journey must be continued

95
00:04:53.666 --> 00:04:56.375
with new energy.

96
00:04:56.375 --> 00:04:57.750
This is the process

97
00:04:57.750 --> 00:05:00.375
of personal development too.

98
00:05:00.375 --> 00:05:02.791
Some people, seeing the distant peak,

99
00:05:02.791 --> 00:05:07.250
don't even start, but the very first

100
00:05:07.250 --> 00:05:11.250
step is the most important.

101
00:05:11.250 --> 00:05:15.833
Some people, while climbing
the mountain, midway

102
00:05:15.833 --> 00:05:19.208
get attracted by good views.

103
00:05:19.208 --> 00:05:23.000
They forget their purpose.

104
00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:28.583
On the path of personal advancement
too, the mind can wander,

105
00:05:28.583 --> 00:05:29.708
but you must keep your eyes fixed

106
00:05:29.708 --> 00:05:34.375
on your goal.

107
00:05:34.375 --> 00:05:37.250
Some people get tired and stop.

108
00:05:37.250 --> 00:05:40.500
If you too ever get tired, then rest

109
00:05:40.500 --> 00:05:42.083
a little,

110
00:05:42.083 --> 00:05:46.250
but this journey must be continued again.

111
00:05:46.250 --> 00:05:49.666
On the path of progress, stopping is

112
00:05:49.666 --> 00:05:52.041
not an option.

113
00:05:52.041 --> 00:05:56.041
For all efforts of life transformation,

114
00:05:56.041 --> 00:05:59.166
this same process will work.

115
00:05:59.166 --> 00:06:00.291
Whether

116
00:06:00.291 --> 00:06:04.166
you want to develop a good habit,

117
00:06:04.166 --> 00:06:08.375
gain control over anger,

118
00:06:08.375 --> 00:06:11.541
or inner peace is your purpose.

119
00:06:11.541 --> 00:06:15.416
Remember these four principles:

120
00:06:15.416 --> 00:06:18.000
Start with faith.

121
00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:22.125
Keep moving forward by 
taking continuous small steps.

122
00:06:22.125 --> 00:06:24.291
Rest when tired,

123
00:06:24.291 --> 00:06:27.833
but don't choose the option of stopping.

124
00:06:27.833 --> 00:06:30.416
And most important –

125
00:06:30.416 --> 00:06:32.750
never forget

126
00:06:32.750 --> 00:06:35.250
your purpose.

127
00:06:35.250 --> 00:06:38.000
This journey takes time,

128
00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:40.125
but only one who keeps walking

129
00:06:40.125 --> 00:06:43.458
will reach the destination.

130
00:06:47.916 --> 00:06:49.458
For advancement

131
00:06:49.458 --> 00:06:54.291
in yoga, continuous effort is essential,

132
00:06:54.291 --> 00:06:56.458
and this same principle

133
00:06:56.458 --> 00:07:00.208
applies to relationships too.

134
00:07:00.208 --> 00:07:03.458
Family or society, deep

135
00:07:03.458 --> 00:07:07.250
relationships aren't built in one day.

136
00:07:07.250 --> 00:07:10.500
They develop gradually
 through trust, understanding,

137
00:07:10.500 --> 00:07:15.625
and small steps of love.

138
00:07:15.625 --> 00:07:17.375
Think,

139
00:07:17.375 --> 00:07:20.125
if you plant a seed in the earth,

140
00:07:20.125 --> 00:07:24.000
can you expect fruit the very next day?

141
00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:25.500
No, right?

142
00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:28.458
You will give that seed daily water,

143
00:07:28.458 --> 00:07:31.833
fertilizer, and sunlight,

144
00:07:31.833 --> 00:07:34.875
and then over time

145
00:07:34.875 --> 00:07:37.625
it will become a fruit-bearing tree.

146
00:07:37.625 --> 00:07:41.708
Similarly, relationships also need time,

147
00:07:41.708 --> 00:07:45.291
love, and care.

148
00:07:45.291 --> 00:07:49.541
Haste will only bring dissatisfaction to you.

149
00:07:49.541 --> 00:07:53.583
Also, a true yogi

150
00:07:53.583 --> 00:07:56.208
stays only in the present

151
00:07:56.208 --> 00:08:00.416
and keeps attention focused on their soul.

152
00:08:00.416 --> 00:08:03.333
They neither grieve for the past,

153
00:08:03.333 --> 00:08:06.208
nor have expectations of the future.

154
00:08:06.208 --> 00:08:10.541
In family relationships too, past discord

155
00:08:10.541 --> 00:08:14.750
or future expectations must be renounced.

156
00:08:14.750 --> 00:08:18.291
Staying in the present, love must be shown,

157
00:08:18.291 --> 00:08:22.750
respect must be given, care must be taken.

158
00:08:22.750 --> 00:08:24.291
If immediate

159
00:08:24.291 --> 00:08:28.041
change isn't visible, don't be disappointed.

160
00:08:28.041 --> 00:08:32.041
Love, respect, and cooperation

161
00:08:32.041 --> 00:08:36.375
water relationships only gradually.

162
00:08:36.375 --> 00:08:38.750
Have faith,

163
00:08:38.750 --> 00:08:42.500
with time, this same relationship will

164
00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:46.333
become such a strong tree

165
00:08:46.333 --> 00:08:50.416
that will be filled with the fruits of love.

166
00:08:54.958 --> 00:08:56.833
Think,

167
00:08:56.833 --> 00:08:58.708
if you try to climb a mountain

168
00:08:58.708 --> 00:09:02.666
very quickly,

169
00:09:02.666 --> 00:09:04.458
what will happen?

170
00:09:04.458 --> 00:09:06.625
You will certainly run,

171
00:09:06.625 --> 00:09:09.500
but you'll get tired soon.

172
00:09:09.500 --> 00:09:13.958
And it's possible you'll get so exhausted

173
00:09:13.958 --> 00:09:17.666
that the enthusiasm to move forward will end.

174
00:09:17.666 --> 00:09:20.500
In today's fast-paced world,

175
00:09:20.500 --> 00:09:21.708
most people

176
00:09:21.708 --> 00:09:25.125
want to get everything immediately.

177
00:09:25.125 --> 00:09:27.708
But this very haste often

178
00:09:27.708 --> 00:09:31.250
stops their journey midway.

179
00:09:31.250 --> 00:09:36.083
On the other hand, some people
 do achieve success quickly,

180
00:09:36.083 --> 00:09:38.666
but that success doesn't last.

181
00:09:38.666 --> 00:09:43.541
Beautiful and lasting success
 doesn't come immediately.

182
00:09:43.541 --> 00:09:47.083
For it, patience, continuous practice,

183
00:09:47.083 --> 00:09:50.250
and concentration are essential.

184
00:09:50.250 --> 00:09:52.250
In professional life too,

185
00:09:52.250 --> 00:09:55.791
many times challenges seem like mountains –

186
00:09:55.791 --> 00:09:58.250
sometimes the goal appears far,

187
00:09:58.250 --> 00:10:02.125
sometimes obstacles seem immovable.

188
00:10:02.125 --> 00:10:06.041
Therefore don't be hasty.

189
00:10:06.041 --> 00:10:11.125
First have faith that success is possible,

190
00:10:11.125 --> 00:10:14.333
because many people have reached

191
00:10:14.333 --> 00:10:16.500
that peak before too.

192
00:10:16.500 --> 00:10:19.041
Then with firm determination

193
00:10:19.041 --> 00:10:23.333
take steps one by one.

194
00:10:23.333 --> 00:10:24.958
When with determination

195
00:10:24.958 --> 00:10:29.041
you make efforts daily, your small

196
00:10:29.041 --> 00:10:30.250
tasks will transform

197
00:10:30.250 --> 00:10:31.583
going forward into

198
00:10:31.583 --> 00:10:34.083
big achievements.

199
00:10:34.083 --> 00:10:37.250
Read the biographies of great people

200
00:10:37.250 --> 00:10:39.500
and understand –

201
00:10:39.500 --> 00:10:43.166
success is only the result of firm determination

202
00:10:43.166 --> 00:10:47.541
and continuous effort.

203
00:10:47.541 --> 00:10:51.125
You must do the same!
